  <VME_CultOfPersonalityDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: story(priority=-999)->-->
    <li>story(priority=-999)-&gt;</li>
    <!--EN: setup->There is no order without a firm hand directing things. This was clear to [founderName], our first [leaderTitle].-->
    <li>setup-&gt;没有坚定的指导就没有命令。我们的第一个 [leaderTitle] [founderName] 很清楚这一点。</li>
    <!--EN: setup->We are the Chosen of [founder_possessive] Divine Will. The sons and daughters of [founderName] [honorific], our first [leaderTitle].-->
    <li>setup-&gt;我们是[founder_possessive]神圣意志的选民。 [founderName] [honorific] 的儿子和女儿，我们的第一个 [leaderTitle]。</li>
    <!--EN: setup->It is told that the first [leaderTitle] of our people, [founderName] [honorific] was forged by the Universe from the clay of creation itself.-->
    <li>setup-&gt;据说，我们人类的第一个[leaderTitle]，[founderName] [honorific]是由宇宙用造物本身的粘土锻造而成的。</li>
    <!--EN: setup->From the terrible chaos embraced by our ancients arose [founderName], our first [leaderTitle].-->
    <li>setup-&gt;从我们的古人所拥抱的可怕混乱中诞生了[founderName]，我们的第一个[leaderTitle]。</li>
    <!--EN: setup->From humble and unremarkable origins, [founderName], our first [leaderTitle], raised above [founder_possessive] station, imposing [founder_possessive] unwavering will.-->
    <li>setup-&gt;出身卑微、不起眼，[founderName]，我们的第一个 [leaderTitle]，在 [founder_possessive] 车站上方升起，赋予 [founder_possessive] 坚定不移的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: honorific->The Magnificent-->
    <li>honorific-&gt;宏伟</li>
    <!--EN: honorific->The Great-->
    <li>honorific-&gt;伟大</li>
    <!--EN: honorific->The Saint-->
    <li>honorific-&gt;圣人</li>
    <!--EN: honorific->The Awe-Inspiring-->
    <li>honorific-&gt;令人敬畏</li>
    <!--EN: honorific->The Conqueror-->
    <li>honorific-&gt;征服者</li>
    <!--EN: honorific->The Resplendent-->
    <li>honorific-&gt;辉煌</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,priority=-10)->The [memberNamePlural] swore eternal loyalty to [founderName] and [founder_possessive] descendants, forever bound in devoted servitude.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,priority=-10)-&gt;[memberNamePlural] 发誓永远效忠 [founderName] 和 [founder_possessive] 后代，永远 束缚 尽心为奴。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,priority=-10)->[founderName] inspired many to lead a life of righteousness, and thus received our unnending devotion.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,priority=-10)-&gt;[founderName]激励了许多人过正义的生活，因此得到了我们无尽的奉献。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,priority=-10)->With an army of [founder_possessive] followers at [founder_possessive] command, the line of [founderName] has lasted till the present, represented by our beloved leader.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,priority=-10)-&gt;在 [founder_possessive] 的指挥下，story(uses=1,priority=-10) 的追随者大军，[founderName] 的队伍一直延续至今，由我们敬爱的领袖代表。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,priority=-10)->Our beloved leader, the latest successor of [founderName], will bring us to prosperity, allowing all of us to live a [memeAdjective] life.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,priority=-10)-&gt;我们敬爱的领袖，[founderName] 的最新继任者，将为我们带来繁荣，让我们所有人过上 [memeAdjective] 的生活。</li>
  </VME_CultOfPersonalityDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
  <VME_EschatologismDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: eschatologismBasis   ->This world is tainted, impure, and it must be purged. We shall bring the end of days and a new Universe will be reborn from the ashes of the current one.-->
    <li>eschatologismBasis   -&gt;这个世界是被污染的、不纯洁的，必须被净化。我们将带来末日，一个新的宇宙将从当前宇宙的灰烬中重生。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismBasis   ->There is nothing of value in this world anymore. Vast post-human intelligences scheming in the dark. Vicious genetically engineered creations rampaging across the land. Greedy, stupid, ambitious humans preying on the weak. It must all be destroyed.-->
    <li>eschatologismBasis   -&gt;这个世界上已经没有任何有价值的东西了。巨大的后人类智慧在黑暗中密谋。邪恶的基因工程创造物在这片土地上肆虐。贪婪、愚蠢、野心勃勃的人类掠夺弱者。必须将其全部摧毁。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismBasis   ->This world needs to be purged. Too long have we left it go unchecked. Human stupidity running rampant and ruining everything.-->
    <li>eschatologismBasis   -&gt;这个世界需要净化。我们对其置之不理已经太久了。人类的愚蠢猖獗，毁掉了一切。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismBasis   ->It is an inescapable fact: the only way forward is to start over and begin anew. This world must be destroyed.-->
    <li>eschatologismBasis   -&gt;这是一个不可避免的事实：前进的唯一出路就是重新开始。这个世界必须被毁灭。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismBasis   ->There is no longer room for compromise. This world is tainted, impure. It must be destroyed.-->
    <li>eschatologismBasis   -&gt;不再有妥协的余地。这个世界是肮脏的、不纯洁的。它必须被摧毁。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact    ->Either through atomic fire or another means, we must bring the Apocalypse.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact    -&gt;无论是通过原子火还是其他方式，我们都必须带来天启。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact    ->The Great Battle at the End of Everything is coming, and we will be prepared.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact    -&gt;一切终结的大战即将到来，我们将做好准备。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact    ->No one must be left alive to rebuild, for the seeds of corruption lie deep within each and any of us.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact    -&gt;任何人都不能活着进行重建，因为腐败的种子深藏在我们每个人的内心深处。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact    ->Nothing but charred remains should be left.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact    -&gt;除了烧焦的残骸外什么都不能留下。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact    ->Once everything has been destroyed. We, the Chosen, shall recreate the world to our liking.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact    -&gt;一旦一切都被摧毁。我们，被选中的人，将按照我们的喜好重建世界。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismProphecy->We will be triumphant.-->
    <li>eschatologismProphecy-&gt;我们将会胜利。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismProphecy->No one shall be ready for our wrath.-->
    <li>eschatologismProphecy-&gt;没有人准备好承受我们的愤怒。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismProphecy->When we finally strike, all shall fall before us.-->
    <li>eschatologismProphecy-&gt;当我们最终出击时，一切都会倒在我们面前。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismProphecy->The days of this world are counted.-->
    <li>eschatologismProphecy-&gt;这个世界的日子已经数算过了。</li>
  </VME_EschatologismDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
  <VME_EsotericismDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: esotericismBasis   ->Beyond the grasp of common science, there is an unsurpassed wealth of secret knowledge.-->
    <li>esotericismBasis   -&gt;除了常识之外，还有无比丰富的秘密知识。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismBasis   ->Hidden to the prying eyes of scientists and philosophers, an occult world of hidden knowledge awaits.-->
    <li>esotericismBasis   -&gt;在科学家和哲学家的窥探之下，一个充满隐藏知识的神秘世界正在等待着他们。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismBasis   ->Science can only bring you so far. Beyond the veil of reality there is a trove of secret knowledge, waiting to be uncovered.-->
    <li>esotericismBasis   -&gt;科学只能带您到目前为止。在现实的面纱之外，还有大量的秘密知识等待着我们去揭开。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismBasis   ->The Universe is too vast to be limited to the constraints of pure math and physics. Beyond such human limitations there is a vast treasure of secret knowledge that can be accessed by those willing to do so at any cost necessary.-->
    <li>esotericismBasis   -&gt;宇宙太大了，无法受到纯数学和物理的限制。除了人类的这些限制之外，还有大量的秘密知识宝藏可供那些愿意不惜一切代价获取的人使用。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismFact    ->Only a select few have the mental strength to acquire such insights.-->
    <li>esotericismFact    -&gt;只有少数人有足够的精神力量获得这样的见解。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismFact    ->These occult insights are not for everyone. Only a small group of sages can explore and observe them. The Chosen Ones.-->
    <li>esotericismFact    -&gt;这些神秘的见解并不适合所有人。只有一小部分圣人能够探索和观察它们。被选中的人。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismFact    ->Such insights would probably be too much for the common folk. Only those with great mental fortitude can peer into the occult... and keep their minds intact.-->
    <li>esotericismFact    -&gt;这样的见解对于普通人来说可能太多了。只有那些具有强大精神毅力的人才能洞察神秘……并保持头脑完整。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy->Perhaps by delving into such knowledge we can even trascend our mortal existence.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy-&gt;也许通过深入研究这些知识，我们甚至可以超越我们的凡人存在。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy->Given enough time, we will crack the most guarded secrets, and finally understand our place in this Universe.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy-&gt;只要有足够的时间，我们将破解最保守的秘密，并最终了解我们在这个宇宙中的位置。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy->The alchemists of antiquity might not have been so foolish in their search for gold, but we are much more ambitious: we will apply the transmundane to our very souls and become more than human.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy-&gt;古代的炼金术士在寻找黄金时可能不会那么愚蠢，但我们更加雄心勃勃：我们将超凡脱俗应用于我们的灵魂，变得超越人类。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy->With such knowledge, we will have a clear advantage over the rest of this planet's inhabitants, and our domination will be all but secured.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并且我们的统治将几乎得到保障。</li>
  </VME_EsotericismDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
  <VME_HedonistDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: lesson(priority=-1)->stuff happens-->
    <li>lesson(priority=-1)-&gt;事情发生了</li>
    <!--EN: r_pattern->"[r_lessonIntro] [r_lessonMain]. [r_lessonReinforcement]"\n\n  - [lessonAttribution]-->
    <li>r_pattern-&gt;“[r_lessonIntro] [r_lessonMain]。[r_lessonReinforcement]”

 - [lessonAttribution]</li>
    <!--EN: lessonAttribution->[founder_nameFull]-->
    <li>lessonAttribution-&gt;[founder_nameFull]</li>
    <!--EN: lessonAttribution(p=2)-><i>[attributionSource_titleCase]</i> by [founder_nameFull]-->
    <li>lessonAttribution(p=2)-&gt;&lt;i&gt;[attributionSource_titleCase]&lt;/i&gt; 由 [founder_nameFull]</li>
    <!--EN: lessonAttribution->[founder_nameFull]'s letter to [believer_nameFull]-->
    <li>lessonAttribution-&gt;[founder_nameFull] 致 [believer_nameFull] 的信</li>
    <!--EN: lessonAttribution->[founder_nameFull], on [founder_possessive] deathbed-->
    <li>lessonAttribution-&gt;[founder_nameFull]，在 [founder_possessive] 临终前</li>
