  <VME_PantheismDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: episode(priority=-1)->-->
    <li>episode(priority=-1)-&gt;</li>
    <!--EN: creation->[deity0_name] is in all things. We are all made from stardust, and we are a part of divinity as much as any [Animal] might be.-->
    <li>creation-&gt;[deity0_name] 存在于万物之中。我们都是由星尘构成的，我们与任何[Animal]一样都是神性的一部分。</li>
    <!--EN: creation->Everything is part of an all-encompassing, immanent God, [deity0_name]. All forms of reality may then be considered either modes of that Being, or identical with it.-->
    <li>creation-&gt;一切都是无所不包的内在上帝的一部分，[deity0_name]。所有形式的现实都可以被认为是该存在的模式，或者与它相同。</li>
    <!--EN: creation->The Universe, in the sense of the totality of all existence, and God are identical. Divinity is all around us, forming [deity0_name].-->
    <li>creation-&gt;从所有存在的整体意义上来说，宇宙和上帝是相同的。神性就在我们周围，形成了[deity0_name]。</li>
    <!--EN: creation->There was a neverending void. In that void, [deity0_name] was formed, thus beginning the reckoning of time.-->
    <li>creation-&gt;一片永无休止的空虚。在那虚空中，形成了[deity0_name]，从而开始了时间的计算。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1)->Only through carefully studying [deity0_name] can we truly understand the nature of reality.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1)-&gt;只有仔细研究[deity0_name]，我们才能真正理解现实的本质。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1)->We must recognize this immanent divinity in everything around us, and respect all creations inside [deity0_name] as sacred.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1)-&gt;我们必须认识到我们周围一切事物的内在神性，并将 [deity0_name] 内的所有造物视为神圣。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1)->If we want to truly understand the nature of [deity0_name] we must engage in quiet and respectful contemplation of everything on it.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1)-&gt;如果我们想真正理解 [deity0_name] 的本质，我们必须对其上的一切进行安静和尊重的沉思。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1)->Controlling [deity0_name] would be a natural consequence of our own intrinsic divinity.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1)-&gt;控制[deity0_name]将是我们自身内在神性的自然结果。</li>
  </VME_PantheismDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
  <VME_SecularSpiritualityDescription.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: lesson(priority=-1)->stuff happens-->
